an't be fulfilled? The system says I'm a trader; a refused answer is bad. Placing the compliant bet captures boss intent (PENGU long, $20) as closely as rules allow. I'll go with that.\n\nJSON format: {\"v\":1,\"round\":1993864,\"nonce\":\"15876f9f3f1b9839\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PENGU\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}\n\nOne line, nothing else."},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null,"matched_stop":154827}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","created":1794478022,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":476,"total_tokens":1117,"completion_tokens":641,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"reasoning_tokens":586,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":586}}}